        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get all service order notes",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://api.mews.com/api/connector/v1/serviceOrderNotes/getAll",
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Returns all notes associated with the given service orders. Service orders can be reservations or product orders. Note this operation uses [Pagination](../guidelines/pagination.md) and supports [Portfolio Access Tokens](../guidelines/multi-property.md).\r\n> **Service order:** This is the general name for an order made against a service, which includes both 'stay' service orders, called [Reservations](reservations.md#reservation), and 'product' service orders, which we simply call [Orders](orders."
